#  API Gateway

Spring Cloud Gateway used as entry point for all microservices.

---

#  Configuration

- Port: 8085
- Routes requests to backend services

---

#  Routing

Routes configured for:

- /countries → Country-City Service
- /cities → Country-City Service
- /countries/{id}/cities → Country-City Service
- /actuator/** → monitoring endpoints
- /swagger-ui/** → API documentation
- /v3/api-docs/** → OpenAPI spec

---

#  Health Aggregation

Endpoint:

- GET /health/all

Returns:
- Gateway status
- Country-City service status

---

# 🚀 Responsibilities

- Central routing
- Request forwarding
- Observability aggregation
